{
  "slug": "worktale-claude-code-plugin",
  "name": "Worktale Claude Code Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automatically narrates your coding sessions into a daily work journal. When you type /worktale, the AI agent starts capturing the \"why\" behind every commit — intent, decisions, trade-offs, and problems solved. After\neach git commit, it runs `worktale note` to append a 1-2 sentence narrative to your local Worktale journal. At end of day, run `worktale digest` to see your full story: AI-narrated context alongside commit stats,\nmodule activity, and streaks. All data stays local in a SQLite database on your machine. Requires the Worktale CLI (npm install -g worktale).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `worktale` (Narrate your coding session into Worktale — automatically adds context, decisions, and intent to your daily work narrative…) and **1 hook**, `SessionEnd`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install worktale-claude-code-plugin@claude-community` from `worktale/worktale-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
